+---
+id: task-004-add-hourly-equipment-rentals
+type: task
+title: "Add hourly equipment rentals"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Extend `addEquipment` with an optional `hourlyPrice` in euro cents. A rental shorter than one day may
+start and end on exact UTC hours and costs the hourly price for each hour. Equipment without an hourly
+price must reject hourly rentals. Preserve daily rentals, availability overlap rules, and the existing
+long-rental discount behaviour.
